cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reuse this harness or cite the null result, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "REGIME: an honest, simulation-only evaluation harness for a Markov regime trading model"
abstract: >-
  A daily walk-forward evaluation harness that measures a Markov regime model against the
  persistence baseline ("tomorrow's regime = today's") and reports the result even when it
  is null. On 20 markets and up to 20 years of history the edge over persistence is exactly
  zero, verified pointwise across 16,773 held-out predictions.
authors:
